# What any folder here produces, and the repository's own working material. The .NET build
# output is in tooling/.gitignore, beside the only projects that write it, and what kac
# generates is in example/.gitignore, beside the corpus it generates from.

# JetBrains Rider — a project directory beside the repository root and beside each project,
# and the state it writes beside kac.slnx after opening it: absolute paths, test-session ids
# and a module file.
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
*.iml

# What `dotnet pack` and `dotnet tool install --tool-path` leave behind when the tool is packed
# and installed from here, as README.md describes. The corpus has its own .dist/, for what kac
# writes, and declares it in example/.gitignore.
.dist/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Working material — drafts and source notes that are not themselves knowledge documents
_plan/
